For those of you who are trying to speed up the game on 286 machines, 
the first and foremost thing is to free up as much memory as possible.  
There are things that you can do, without recompiling, to speed up your 
games -- turning off status line options, such as SHOWEXP, and TIME, 
will cut down on the amount of screen writing the game has to do, and 
may speed up the game.

